SUMMARY:Round The Ramparts
DESCRIPTION:Leader: Andy Dingley\n\nStarting at Wyhe Cutting Bus Stop.  Thi
 s is an 11km run along to British Camp and around the ramparts.  Headtorch 
 required.  All trail - so trail shoes preferable especially in wet conditio
 ns. 6:30 - 7:15 mins per km roughly\n\nView on Strava: https://www.strava.c
 om/clubs/208705/group_events/3455162324584765606\n\nSynced from Strava Club
  208705 on Sun\, 10 May @ 10:52 AM
