BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:3487915057745045050@strava.com
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260513T183000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260513T193000
DTSTAMP:20260510T095255Z
SUMMARY:Fun on the Common
DESCRIPTION:Leader: Martin Thomas\n\nEfforts session suitable for all abili
 ties/paces. \n\nWarm up followed by a series of low hill repeats then cool 
 down stretches. \n\nThe whole session is within a short distance from the m
 eet point and all done in an hour. \n\nIt’s all about structured effort a
 nd recovery. Good for progressing and building resilience.\n\nNot a single 
 loop run so you can’t get left behind. If you are coming back from injury
  or new to efforts … you can also sit out for a loop if needed. \n\nCome 
 and have some fun\n\nMartin\n[Phone Number Redacted]\n\nView on Strava: htt
 ps://www.strava.com/clubs/208705/group_events/3487915057745045050\n\nSynced
  from Strava Club 208705 on Sun\, 10 May @ 10:52 AM
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:Leader: Martin ThomasEfforts session suitable 
 for all abilities/paces. Warm up followed by a series of low hill repeats t
 hen cool down stretches. The whole session is within a short distance from 
 the meet point and all done in an hour. It’s all about structured effort 
 and recovery. Good for progressing and building resilience.Not a single loo
 p run so you can’t get left behind. If you are coming back from injury or
  new to efforts … you can also sit out for a loop if needed. Come and hav
 e some funMartin[Phone Number Redacted]View on Strava: https://www.strava.c
 om/clubs/208705/group_events/3487915057745045050Synced from Strava Club 208
 705 on: Sun\, 10 May @ 10:52 AM
LOCATION:Churchdown Road Malvern England WR14 United Kingdom
URL:https://www.strava.com/clubs/208705/group_events/3487915057745045050
CATEGORIES:Running,Club Event
END:VEVENT
